          "description": {
            "comment": "Annotated genome assembly of Bemisia tabaci Q-type almeria. Falcon was used to assembly CLR data and haplotig removal. Manual curation and Hi-C scaffolding using juicer and 3d-dna. Error correction was done using Freebayes route. Maker annotation pipeline used with both transcriptome transfer and de novo gene prediction as inputs to Evigene to pick best gene models. Curation of P450, ABC, UGT, IRAC gene models where RNA-seq evidence was present. Unknown sex multi-individual used for PacBio CLR and Hi-C. Originally sourced from Spain. Obtained by Syngenta from Rothamsted Research in 2007",
